WEBVTT

00:19:58.953 --> 00:20:01.303
and we qualified
for the Paralympics in Rio.

00:20:01.327 --> 00:20:04.016
That was surreal.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.613
AG: And she says none of this
would have been possible

00:20:06.637 --> 00:20:09.408
without everyone at SAP cheering her on.

00:20:09.432 --> 00:20:10.598
FS: Playing any sport,

00:20:10.622 --> 00:20:14.068
dedicating time to train,
to travel with the team,

00:20:14.092 --> 00:20:15.906
is so very important.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.246
A great way that SAP
has supported me in this

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:20.966
is by giving me the time to compete.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.786
AG: Today, four years later,
their encouragement hasn't stopped.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.810
Felicia and her team
will soon be competing

00:20:26.834 --> 00:20:29.806
at the 2020 Paralympics in Tokyo.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.516
FS: But if volleyball ends,